  - digital public good
  - open source
abstract: >-
  VaxGuard is Module 4 of the EpiCalc Suite: a vaccine cold chain
  monitoring tool for Community Health Workers assessing vaccine potency
  when cold chain integrity is uncertain. It implements the WHO/FDA
  Arrhenius-based Mean Kinetic Temperature (MKT) formula (ICH Q1E
  guideline) to compute residual potency and a three-tier use/
  conditional/discard decision, with presets for five WHO EPI vaccines
  (OPV, BCG, Measles, DTP/Penta, HepB) and Vaccine Vial Monitor (VVM)
  cross-checking. The interface is fully localized in English, French,
  Swahili, and Korean. The app runs entirely client-side as an
  installable, offline-capable Progressive Web App, with no data
  collection.
